        <p>ⓐ $$R(x) = - \frac{\left( {x + 8} \right)\left( {x + 1} \right)}{\left( {x - 2} \right)\left( {x + 3} \right)}$$ ⓑ $$R(x) = \frac{x + 1}{x + 3}$$</p>
